title: OpenAI Status: Provider overview
agents: openai_statuspage
catalog: app
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-openai extension
description: Monitors the provider-wide status indicator published by OpenAI. This service intentionally does not use component counts to determine its state; component health is evaluated by OpenAI Status Components. The live provider page is https://status.openai.com/. States can be remapped with the OpenAI public status policy.
discovery: One service is created whenever the openai_statuspage agent section is present.
